# {{projectName}}

Laravel golden path generated by InitPad. Dependencies are locked in `composer.lock`.

- `composer install` installs dependencies
- `vendor/bin/phpunit` runs HTTP tests
- `docker build .` creates the same runtime image used in every environment

The container creates an ephemeral `APP_KEY` when none is configured so the
first deployment starts safely. Before storing sessions or encrypted data,
add a persistent `APP_KEY` as an InitPad environment secret. Generate one with
`php -r 'echo "base64:" . base64_encode(random_bytes(32)) . PHP_EOL;'`.
Sessions and cache use the container filesystem by default; configure shared
stores through environment variables when running more than one replica.
